</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 6</span><span class="cl"><span class="se"></span>--tmpfs /run <span class="se">\
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 7</span><span class="cl"><span class="se"></span>--tmpfs /tmp <span class="se">\
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 8</span><span class="cl"><span class="se"></span>-v /mnt/money/wxedge_storage:/storage:rw <span class="se">\
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln"> 9</span><span class="cl"><span class="se"></span>-d <span class="se">\
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">10</span><span class="cl"><span class="se"></span>registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/onething/wxedge
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="设备绑定">设备绑定</h2>
